{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>איש אף</b> — He sees with his anger; therefore he is called אף." "<b>יגרה</b> — is sweet." "<b>חמה</b> — harsher than אף. And the proof: וחמתו בערה בו. And אף is in the face only."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {2 "Reading והעד as introducing a prooftext (והעד = 'and the proof/witness'); possibly corrupt."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:27.442280267Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}